{"seq":1,"slug":"simulation-modeling","title":"数值仿真与建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/tuning/simulation-modeling","wordCount":1603,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值仿真与建模\">数值仿真与建模</h1><p>改一个掉率系数，三个月后会不会引发通胀？给某英雄加 5% 攻击，整个 meta 会怎样移动？这些问题不能等上线后才知道答案——代价太大。仿真与建模的使命，是在玩家接触之前，用模型在计算机里把经济与战斗「跑一遍」，预演改动的后果。本篇专讲建模方法、蒙特卡洛仿真与智能体模拟。建模的输入是前面各篇的公式——成长曲线（见 <a href=\"../foundations/number-systems-curves\">数值体系与成长曲线</a>）、伤害模型（见 <a href=\"../combat-balance/combat-models\">战斗数值模型</a>）、经济循环（见 <a href=\"../economy/economic-loops\">游戏内经济循环</a>）；仿真的输出再交给 <a href=\"data-driven-tuning\">数据驱动调优</a> 与真实数据比对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏建模有三个抽象层级，从简到繁：闭式解析模型（用公式直接算期望，最快但简化最多）、蒙特卡洛模拟（重复随机抽样统计分布，处理随机性）、智能体模拟（让虚拟玩家在系统里自主行动，捕捉涌现行为）。层级越高越真实，但成本与不确定性也越高。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[数值模型] --&gt; B[解析模型&lt;br/&gt;闭式期望计算]&#10;  A --&gt; C[蒙特卡洛&lt;br/&gt;随机抽样统计]&#10;  A --&gt; D[智能体模拟&lt;br/&gt;虚拟玩家行为]&#10;  B --&gt; E[快速但忽略方差/行为]&#10;  C --&gt; F[得分布而非点估计]&#10;  D --&gt; G[捕捉涌现/策略博弈]&#10;  E --&gt; H[改动预演]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{符合设计目标?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[调参数重跑]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[进入灰度上线]&#10;  J --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[数值模型] --&gt; B[解析模型&lt;br/&gt;闭式期望计算]\n  A --&gt; C[蒙特卡洛&lt;br/&gt;随机抽样统计]\n  A --&gt; D[智能体模拟&lt;br/&gt;虚拟玩家行为]\n  B --&gt; E[快速但忽略方差/行为]\n  C --&gt; F[得分布而非点估计]\n  D --&gt; G[捕捉涌现/策略博弈]\n  E --&gt; H[改动预演]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{符合设计目标?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[调参数重跑]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[进入灰度上线]\n  J --&gt; A</pre><p>下表对比三类模型的适用与局限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>处理随机性</th>\n<th>处理玩家行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解析模型</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>仅期望</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>快速 sanity check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是（得分布）</td>\n<td>弱（脚本化）</td>\n<td>抽卡/掉落/通胀预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>智能体模拟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（自主决策）</td>\n<td>meta 演化、经济涌现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"解析模型-先算清期望\">解析模型：先算清期望</h2><p>任何调参前，第一步永远是闭式解析估算——它几乎零成本，却能挡掉大部分离谱设计。比如要评估一个抽卡卡池的玩家成本，直接用 <a href=\"../foundations/probability-random\">概率与随机系统</a> 里的综合期望抽数公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[N]=\\sum_i i\\cdot q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 算出平均出货抽数，再乘单抽价格，立刻知道「平均花多少钱毕业」。</p>\n<p>解析模型的价值是「快速否定」：如果连期望都不对（比如某材料的期望日产出远低于养成需求），根本不用跑复杂仿真就知道要改。它的局限是只给期望、不给分布——它告诉你「平均 62 抽出货」，却不告诉你「10% 的非酋会抽到 100 抽以上」。而玩家体验恰恰由这些尾部决定，所以解析之后往往要上蒙特卡洛补足方差信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蒙特卡洛-跑出分布\">蒙特卡洛：跑出分布</h2><p>蒙特卡洛仿真的思路朴素而强大：把一次随机过程（一次抽卡序列、一天的掉落、一个月的经济运转）写成可执行的模拟，重复跑成千上万次，统计结果分布。它能回答解析模型答不了的问题——不只是均值，还有方差、分位数、最坏情况。</p>\n<p>以抽卡成本为例，重复模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次「抽到出货为止」，记录每次的抽数，得到完整分布。仿真估计的均值标准误差随次数下降：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0376em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着要把估计精度提高 10 倍，需要把模拟次数提高 100 倍——这是仿真的基本成本规律，决定了跑多少次才够。蒙特卡洛在经济建模里尤其有用：把全服玩家一个月的产出与消耗按概率模拟出来，能预测货币总流通量的走势，提前发现 <a href=\"../economy/inflation-faucet-sink\">通货膨胀与水龙头水槽</a> 里的失衡苗头。下表示意一次抽卡成本蒙特卡洛的输出：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统计量</th>\n<th>值（抽数）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均值</td>\n<td>62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中位数</td>\n<td>58</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90 分位</td>\n<td>88</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99 分位</td>\n<td>90（硬保底封顶）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"智能体模拟-捕捉涌现\">智能体模拟：捕捉涌现</h2><p>最高阶的建模是 agent-based simulation——给虚拟玩家赋予目标与策略（追求最优战力、追求性价比、随机探索），让他们在系统里自主行动，观察宏观现象如何「涌现」。它能捕捉解析与蒙特卡洛都看不到的东西：玩家会自发收敛到某个最优 build（meta 形成）、会发现设计师没预料的套利路径、会在市场里产生囤积与投机行为。</p>\n<p>智能体模拟的难点在于「玩家模型的保真度」——虚拟玩家越像真人，结论越可信，但建模真人行为极难。实践中常用简化策略（理性最大化、有限理性、若干玩家原型混合）来逼近。近年也有团队用强化学习训练智能体自行探索策略空间，让 AI 玩家去「攻破」设计师的平衡，从而暴露漏洞。这类模拟对验证 <a href=\"../combat-balance/balancing-methods\">平衡性方法</a> 里的 meta 健康度、以及 <a href=\"../economy/trading-markets\">交易与市场</a> 的市场稳定性特别有价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建模的纪律与陷阱\">建模的纪律与陷阱</h2><p>仿真不是越复杂越好。最大的陷阱是「精确的错误」——一个参数标定失真的复杂模型，会给出看似精密实则误导的结论，比一个诚实的粗糙估算更危险。建模纪律有几条：模型必须可证伪（上线后用真实数据回测，对不上就修模型）；从简单模型起步，只在简单模型不够时才加复杂度；明确标注每个假设，因为假设错了结论全错。</p>\n<p>仿真的输出永远是「假设条件下的预测」，不是真理。它的正确用法是「缩小不确定性、排除明显错误的方案」，而非「替代真实数据」。模型预测与真实表现的差距，本身就是宝贵的校准信号——这正是仿真与 <a href=\"data-driven-tuning\">数据驱动调优</a> 必须闭环的原因：仿真预演、上线、真实数据回测、修正模型、再预演。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>建模分三层：解析模型（算期望、最快）、蒙特卡洛（跑分布、处理随机）、智能体模拟（捕捉涌现行为），层级越高越真实但成本越高。</li>\n<li>调参前先做解析估算「快速否定」离谱方案，但它只给期望、不给分布，尾部体验需蒙特卡洛补足。</li>\n<li>蒙特卡洛重复模拟统计分布，能给方差与分位数；精度随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE=\\sigma/\\sqrt{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提升，精度翻 10 倍需次数翻 100 倍。</li>\n<li>智能体模拟让虚拟玩家自主行动以捕捉 meta 形成、套利、市场投机等涌现现象，难点是玩家行为保真度。</li>\n<li>建模纪律：警惕「精确的错误」、模型须可证伪、从简起步、标注假设；仿真只缩小不确定性，必须与真实数据回测闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值仿真与建模","id":"数值仿真与建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"解析模型：先算清期望","id":"解析模型-先算清期望"},{"level":2,"text":"蒙特卡洛：跑出分布","id":"蒙特卡洛-跑出分布"},{"level":2,"text":"智能体模拟：捕捉涌现","id":"智能体模拟-捕捉涌现"},{"level":2,"text":"建模的纪律与陷阱","id":"建模的纪律与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交易与市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/economy/trading-markets"},"next":{"title":"数据驱动调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/tuning/data-driven-tuning"}}